<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    
    <!-- Bootstrap CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .bg-navy {
            background-color: #071A2B;
        }
        .text-gold {
            color: #C5A45A;
        }
        .border-gold {
            border-color: #C5A45A !important;
        }
        .btn-gold {
            background-color: #C5A45A;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .btn-gold:hover {
            background-color: #b0914c;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .academic-section-card {
            border: 1px solid rgba(197, 164, 90, 0.3);
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #ffffff;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }
        .academic-section-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(7, 26, 43, 0.08);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header / Navigation Partial -->
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <!-- Page Header Banner -->
    <section class="bg-navy py-5 text-white text-center" style="border-bottom: 4px solid #C5A45A;">
        <div class="container py-4">
            <span class="text-uppercase fw-bold text-gold tracking-wider" style="font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 1.5px;">Comprehensive Curriculum Overview</span>
            <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold text-gold my-3">Academic Programs & Frameworks</h1>
            <p class="lead mx-auto" style="max-width: 700px; color: #b9c4d0;">
                Fostering intellectual curiosity, critical thinking, and structured lifelong achievement across all developmental stages at Balanagar, Hyderabad.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Overall Academic Philosophy -->
    <section class="py-5 bg-white">
        <div class="container py-3">
            <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <span class="text-uppercase fw-bold text-gold" style="font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 1.5px;">Educational Philosophy</span>
                    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4" style="color: #071A2B;">A Balanced Path from Foundation to Mastery</h2>
                    <p class="text-muted mb-4" style="line-height: 1.8;">
                        At St. Martin's High School, our academic framework is built on experiential inquiry, conceptual depth, and ethical grounding. We move beyond rote learning to ensure students can synthesize knowledge, solve real-world problems, and adapt confidently to an evolving global landscape.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled text-muted" style="line-height: 2;">
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-gold me-2"></i> Inquiry-driven, activity-based learning approaches</li>
                        <li class="mb-1"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-gold me-2"></i> Strong integration of STEM, humanities, and fine arts</li>
                        <li class="mb-1"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-gold me-2"></i> Continuous formative and summative feedback loops</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-gold me-2"></i> Values-based mentorship embedded into daily instruction</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="p-4 rounded shadow-sm bg-navy text-white border-start border-4 border-gold">
                        <h4 class="text-gold mb-3"><i class="fas fa-bullseye me-2"></i> Academic Pillars</h4>
                        <p style="color: #b9c4d0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;" class="mb-3">
                            Every grade tier is strategically designed to match cognitive milestones, ensuring a seamless transition from foundational mechanics to advanced critical analysis.
                        </p>
                        <div class="row text-center mt-4 pt-3 border-top border-secondary">
                            <div class="col-4">
                                <h3 class="text-gold fw-bold mb-0">100%</h3>
                                <small style="color: #b9c4d0; font-size: 12px;">Engagement</small>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-4">
                                <h3 class="text-gold fw-bold mb-0">Smart</h3>
                                <small style="color: #b9c4d0; font-size: 12px;">Labs & Tech</small>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-4">
                                <h3 class="text-gold fw-bold mb-0">Holistic</h3>
                                <small style="color: #b9c4d0; font-size: 12px;">Growth</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Comprehensive Tier Section: Primary, Middle, Secondary -->
    <section class="py-5" style="background-color: #f1f4f8;">
        <div class="container py-3">
            <div class="text-center mb-5">
                <span class="text-uppercase fw-bold text-gold" style="letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 13px;">Complete Curriculum Breakdown</span>
                <h2 class="fw-bold" style="color: #071A2B;">From Primary Years to Board Examination Prep</h2>
                <p class="text-muted">Explore the detailed learning objectives for each school tier.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Tier 1: Primary School -->
            <div class="academic-section-card p-4 p-lg-5 mb-4">
                <div class="row align-items-center g-4">
                    <div class="col-lg-4">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                            <div class="bg-navy text-gold p-3 rounded me-3 shadow-sm">
                                <i class="fas fa-child fa-2x"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="fw-bold mb-0" style="color: #071A2B;">Primary School</h3>
                                <span class="badge bg-secondary text-gold mt-1">Classes I to V</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-0" style="line-height: 1.7;">
                            Building joyful foundations in literacy, numerical fluency, social collaboration, and environmental appreciation through dynamic, play-way techniques.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-8 border-start-lg ps-lg-4">
                        <h5 class="text-navy fw-bold mb-3" style="color: #071A2B;">Key Focus Areas & Curriculum Highlights:</h5>
                        <div class="row g-3 text-muted small">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0" style="line-height: 1.8;">
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right text-gold me-2"></i> Phonetic language mastery & creative expression</li>
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right text-gold me-2"></i> Activity-based mathematical concepts</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0" style="line-height: 1.8;">
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right text-gold me-2"></i> Environmental science & experiential observation</li>
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right text-gold me-2"></i> Art, crafts, music, and motor skills development</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tier 2: Middle School -->
            <div class="academic-section-card p-4 p-lg-5 mb-4">
                <div class="row align-items-center g-4">
                    <div class="col-lg-4">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                            <div class="bg-navy text-gold p-3 rounded me-3 shadow-sm">
                                <i class="fas fa-book-reader fa-2x"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="fw-bold mb-0" style="color: #071A2B;">Middle School</h3>
                                <span class="badge bg-secondary text-gold mt-1">Classes VI to VIII</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-0" style="line-height: 1.7;">
                            Transitioning students toward analytical thinking, independent study habits, experimental science investigations, and deeper conceptual command.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-8 border-start-lg ps-lg-4">
                        <h5 class="text-navy fw-bold mb-3" style="color: #071A2B;">Key Focus Areas & Curriculum Highlights:</h5>
                        <div class="row g-3 text-muted small">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0" style="line-height: 1.8;">
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right text-gold me-2"></i> Advanced general science & social studies</li>
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right text-gold me-2"></i> Introduction to basic coding & computer tech</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0" style="line-height: 1.8;">
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right text-gold me-2"></i> Structured project-based investigations</li>
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right text-gold me-2"></i> Public speaking, debates, and leadership circles</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tier 3: Secondary School -->
            <div class="academic-section-card p-4 p-lg-5">
                <div class="row align-items-center g-4">
                    <div class="col-lg-4">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                            <div class="bg-navy text-gold p-3 rounded me-3 shadow-sm">
                                <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap fa-2x"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="fw-bold mb-0" style="color: #071A2B;">Secondary School</h3>
                                <span class="badge bg-secondary text-gold mt-1">Classes IX & X</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-0" style="line-height: 1.7;">
                            Rigorous preparation for board examinations, specialized academic counseling, analytical problem-solving, and building high-level credentials.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-8 border-start-lg ps-lg-4">
                        <h5 class="text-navy fw-bold mb-3" style="color: #071A2B;">Key Focus Areas & Curriculum Highlights:</h5>
                        <div class="row g-3 text-muted small">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0" style="line-height: 1.8;">
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right text-gold me-2"></i> Comprehensive board exam coaching & mock tests</li>
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right text-gold me-2"></i> Advanced physics, chemistry, biology, & math labs</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0" style="line-height: 1.8;">
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right text-gold me-2"></i> Individualized career roadmap counseling</li>
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right text-gold me-2"></i> Time management & stress handling workshops</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Student Support & Assessment Systems -->
    <section class="py-5 bg-white text-center">
        <div class="container py-2" style="max-width: 800px;">
            <span class="text-uppercase fw-bold text-gold" style="font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 1.5px;">Continuous Quality Control</span>
            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color: #071A2B;">Student Support & Assessment Systems</h3>
            <p class="text-muted mb-4" style="line-height: 1.7;">
                We maintain optimized class sizes to guarantee individual attention. Regular feedback loops, structured remedial support sessions, and active parent-teacher collaborations ensure that every student stays on track to achieve their highest academic potential.
            </p>
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-3">
                <a href="/admissions" class="btn btn-gold px-4 py-2">Apply For Admission</a>
                <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline-dark px-4 py-2">Contact Academic Cell</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Global Footer Partial -->
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

    <!-- Bootstrap JS Bundle -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>